183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (In everyday life, people receive various documents containing information that may be required later. These include purchase receipts, warranty cards, medicine labels, subscription notices, and other important records. Such documents may contain purchase details, expiry dates, warranty periods, and renewal information. When these details are scattered across physical documents and digital images, retrieving them at the right time can become difficult.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (ECHO is an AI-powered personal memory assistant developed to help users capture, organize, store, and retrieve important information from everyday documents. By integrating OCR, machine learning, database management, and rule-based logic, the system aims to provide a convenient platform for managing personal information.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (The application is designed as a web-based system that allows users to interact with its features through a browser. It combines text extraction, automatic categorization, information storage, and reminder management within a single application.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
