/E (The project demonstrates how artificial intelligence and web technologies can be combined to reduce the manual effort involved in managing documents such as receipts, warranty cards, medicine labels, and subscription notices. The trained classification model achieved 98.7% cross-validation accuracy on the available dataset. However, the complete document-processing workflow requires further validation because Tesseract OCR was not correctly configured in the local environment during testing.)
